* PVCELL VDMOS C_gd fit for SCT4036KRHR: drain ramp 0..800 V, gate held at 0.0 V
.model m VDMOS(Vto=3.8 Kp=2.881 lambda=0.01 Rd=0.01056 Rs=0.5m Rg=1.0 Cgs=2.33e-09 Cgdmax=4.67e-10 Cgdmin=5e-12 a=0.04017 Cjo=1.063e-09 Vj=3 M=0.5 Is=7.58e-16 N=3 Rb=0.01733 Tt=0)
Vg g 0 0.0
Vd dd 0 PWL(0 0 10u 800.0)
Rd dd dn 1m
M1 dn g 0 m
.save i(Vg) v(dn)
.tran 5n 10u
.control
run
wrdata pv_fit_SCT4036KRHR.dat i(Vg) v(dn)
quit
.endc
.end
